    <packaging>jar</packaging>

    <name>jawelte tests/jta-module scenario 46: auto-switch-resource-local-to-jta</name>
    <description>jta-module test scenario. A persistence unit declared with transaction-type=RESOURCE_LOCAL in persistence.xml is auto-corrected to JTA at EMF bootstrap when jta-module is on the classpath; an INFO log is emitted when no explicit transactionType was configured. Verifies that EntityManagerFactory.getProperties() reports JTA and that the warning is fired exactly once for that PU.</description>
